    copy: "Set a level, get a push the moment it breaks — checked every 20 seconds. Regime-change alerts fire automatically when the options market flips from contango to backwardation." },
  { icon: "flask", title: "Backtest lab",
    copy: "Walk-forward backtests per strategy — win rate, total return, max drawdown, Sharpe, and the full trade log. Verify before you trust." },
