    copy: "Headlines per asset with sentiment scoring, plus an AI read on what the news implies for short-term price action." },
  { icon: "comment", title: "AI analyst notes",
    copy: "On-demand analyst commentary for any symbol — what's driving it, what to watch, in plain English." },
  { icon: "calendar", title: "Earnings calendar",
    copy: "Upcoming earnings across the market, so a surprise print never blindsides an open position." },
  { icon: "calendar-clock", title: "Economic calendar",
