    q: "What is the Power Moves 10X scanner?",
    a: "A breakout scanner that screens indices, forex, commodities and crypto through three generations of Pine-script-aligned engines. The v3 'Super Pine' engine looks for five structural signals — thrust, base, uptrend, new-high reclaim, and regime breakout — and every engine has a historical backtest viewer so you can see how its signals actually performed.",
  },
