  },
  {
    q: "What is the tariff exposure tool?",
    a: "A browsable ranking of 113+ countries by their US tariff rate, with per-sector breakdowns, debt-to-USA context, and plain-English explanations of what each rate means. Made for anyone following how tariffs hit real companies and countries — exposure at a glance, without a spreadsheet.",
