        </Reveal>
        <Reveal as="article" class="persona persona--featured">
          <span class="persona__icon"><Icon name="bolt" size={22} /></span>
          <h3>The professional trader</h3>
          <p>You need a level, not a vibe.</p>
          <ul>
            <li>AI signals with entry, stop, target &amp; confidence</li>
            <li>10X breakout scanner with real backtests</li>
            <li>Alerts that push the moment a level breaks</li>
            <li>Pre-market and after-hours session prices</li>
          </ul>
        </Reveal>
        <Reveal as="article" class="persona">
          <span class="persona__icon"><Icon name="shield" size={22} /></span>
          <h3>The compliance team</h3>
          <p>You answer for exposure, on the record.</p>
