    </section>

    <!-- ── Live global markets board ────────────────────────────────────── -->
    <LiveBoard />

    <!-- ── AI Signals ───────────────────────────────────────────────────── -->
    <section class="feature" id="signals">
      <Reveal as="div" class="feature__copy">
        <p class="eyebrow">AI Trading Signals</p>
        <h2>Not just "bullish."<br />Entry. Stop. Target.</h2>
        <p>
          Nine strategy engines analyze 49+ assets across commodities, indices,
          forex and crypto — and commit to an answer: <span class="pill pill--buy">BUY</span>
          <span class="pill pill--hold">HOLD</span> <span class="pill pill--sell">SELL</span>
          with a concrete entry, stop-loss, take-profit, risk/reward ratio, confidence
          score, and the reasoning behind the call.
        </p>
        <ul class="checklist">
          <li>Strategies S1–S9 for different styles — including S9, a silver-specific liquidity-sweep engine</li>
          <li>Walk-forward backtests per strategy: win rate, return, drawdown, Sharpe, full trade log</li>
          <li>Charts with SMA, EMA, RSI, MACD, Stochastic, ATR, ADX, Bollinger and pivots</li>
          <li>AI analyst notes, news with sentiment scoring, and fundamentals per symbol</li>
          <li>Price alerts that push to your phone the moment a level breaks</li>
        </ul>
      </Reveal>
      <Reveal as="div" class="feature__media feature__media--signal">
        <DeviceFrame
          src={shotSignals}
          alt="AI signal board with BUY, HOLD and SELL calls and confidence percentages across gold, silver, crude oil and more"
          variant="iphone"
          class="feature__media-phone"
