        <SignalCard />
      </Reveal>
    </section>

    <!-- ── Power Moves scanner ──────────────────────────────────────────── -->
    <section class="feature feature--reverse" id="scanner">
      <Reveal as="div" class="feature__copy">
        <p class="eyebrow">Power Moves — 10X Scanner</p>
        <h2>Catch the breakout<br />before it's a headline.</h2>
        <p>
          A regime-breakout scanner that screens whole asset classes — indices, forex,
          commodities, crypto — through three generations of Pine-aligned engines.
          The v3 "Super Pine" engine hunts five structural signals and ranks
          everything by how many are firing right now.
        </p>
        <ul class="checklist">
          <li>Five signals: thrust, base, uptrend, new-high reclaim, regime breakout</li>
          <li>Historical backtest viewer — see each engine's real win rates first</li>
          <li>Best Setups: pre-filtered highest-conviction opportunities by sector</li>
          <li>Multibagger scans across US, India, UK, Japan, HK, China and Euronext</li>
          <li>Country-aware stock search — scan any single stock on demand</li>
        </ul>
      </Reveal>
      <Reveal as="div" class="feature__media">
        <DeviceFrame
          src={shotScanner}
          alt="Power Moves 10X scanner running the v3 Super Pine engine across global indices"
          variant="iphone"
        />
      </Reveal>
    </section>

    <!-- ── Live Markets ─────────────────────────────────────────────────── -->
    <section class="feature" id="markets">
      <Reveal as="div" class="feature__copy">
        <p class="eyebrow">Live Global Markets</p>
        <h2>Every market that matters.<br />One screen.</h2>
        <p>
          46 global indices, 23 commodities, and 44 forex pairs — streaming live with
          candlestick charts on tap. Plus CFTC hedge-fund positioning on metals and
          central-bank policy rates, so you see what the big money holds and what
          the policy gravity looks like.
        </p>
        <ul class="checklist">
          <li>US, Europe and Asia indices from the S&amp;P 500 to the Nifty 50</li>
          <li>Gold, oil, gas, copper, grains — the full commodities complex</li>
          <li>Majors, crosses and EM forex, grouped by region</li>
          <li>Pre-market and after-hours session prices where available</li>
          <li>Watchlists and full-text search across every listed stock</li>
        </ul>
      </Reveal>
      <Reveal as="div" class="feature__media feature__media--duo">
        <DeviceFrame
          src={shotMarkets}
          alt="FinBrio markets dashboard showing S&P 500, NASDAQ and Dow Jones live with sector wheel"
          variant="iphone"
        />
        <DeviceFrame
          src={shotTrading}
          alt="Live commodities quotes: gold, silver, crude oil, natural gas and more with real-time changes"
          variant="iphone"
          class="feature__media-offset"
        />
      </Reveal>
    </section>

    <!-- ── Treemap (iPad, full width) ───────────────────────────────────── -->
