      <Reveal as="div" class="showcase__head">
        <p class="eyebrow">Market-Cap Treemap</p>
        <h2>The whole index. One glance.</h2>
        <p>
          A market-cap-weighted heatmap of nine major indices — S&amp;P 500, NASDAQ 100,
          Dow, Russell 2000, FTSE 100, DAX 40, Nikkei 225, Hang Seng and Nifty 50 —
