        </p>
        <ul class="checklist">
          <li>Market regime read across 48 assets: bullish, bearish, quiet, chaotic</li>
          <li>VIX term-structure detection — know when contango flips to backwardation</li>
          <li>Historical crisis playbook — how each asset class behaved in past crises</li>
          <li>Live US debt clock and high-impact economic calendar (FOMC, CPI, NFP)</li>
          <li>AI macro briefings that explain the stress picture in plain English</li>
        </ul>
        <p class="feature__link">
          <a href="/indicators/yield-curve">Yield curve</a> ·
          <a href="/indicators/vix">VIX</a> ·
          <a href="/indicators/fear-and-greed">Fear &amp; Greed</a> ·
          <a href="/us-debt-clock">US debt clock</a>
        </p>
      </Reveal>
      <Reveal as="div" class="feature__media feature__media--duo">
        <DeviceFrame
          src={shotMacro}
          alt="FinBrio macro dashboard with market regime breakdown and VIX gauge reading 17.4"
          variant="iphone"
        />
